OR ACCURACY OF METEOROLOGICAL FORECASTS.

METEOROLOGICAL AND SAFETY NOTICE:
SANGAM is an experimental research and multi-model forecast blending prototype.
Atmospheric forecasts generated or blended by SANGAM are computational estimates
subject to meteorological uncertainty, observational gaps, and model bias.
SANGAM is NOT certified as an official meteorological alert authority. SANGAM
shall NOT be relied upon as the sole or primary basis for life-safety, aviation,
marine navigation, emergency evacuation, or disaster response decisions. All
critical weather advisories must be cross-referenced with authoritative notices
issued by designated governmental authorities, such as the India Meteorological
Department (IMD).

